  <h2>Why ready stock is useful for Russian buyers</h2>
  <p>
    Ready stock gives the buyer a faster path: choose existing proven silhouettes, order samples, add private label elements and start selling. This is especially useful when the buyer needs product content, influencer samples or a small market test.
  </p>

  <h2>What ready stock cannot solve</h2>
  <p>
    Ready stock is not the best choice when a brand needs an exclusive fabric, proprietary pattern, unique color development or technical product engineering. In those cases, OEM/ODM development is a better long-term route, but it usually requires more sampling time and higher MOQ.
  </p>

  <h2>How to brief Fitclo for a faster quote</h2>
